Program          : DRVEC 0.1.0 (python)
Input Data File  : the .pre files
Output File      : rank.out
Model            : VARMA-VECM(2,0), M = 3 series, cointegration rank r = 0..2 (sequential test)
Estimation       : Exact Unconditional Maximum Likelihood, Algorithm AS 311 (Mauricio 1997), xi sequence truncated at 1e-3
Transformation   : VECM to stationary VARMA (Mauricio 2006)
Deterministic    : case 3 -- E[nabla Y2] free, E[W] free (drifts as in the .pre files)
Structure        : F free, Theta absent (q = 0), Sigma free
Series           : BUFFALO MINNEAPOLIS KANSASCITY   (2 in the nabla Y2 block, 1 in Y1)
Sample           : 99 observations from 1972/9, monthly (raw 100)

=== Sequential LR test for the cointegration rank ===

=== The ladder below the rank: r = 0, from the gate up ===
  rung 0  (F diag, Theta diag, Sigma diag)   logL = -901.0562829728

=== Entry gate: the factorisation contract ===

At r = 0 with diagonal Phi, Theta and Sigma the likelihood factorises,
so the joint fit must equal the sum of the univariate fits exactly.

  univariate 1 (p=2, q=0)   logL =    -296.5756786209
  univariate 2 (p=2, q=0)   logL =    -299.8033848238
  univariate 3 (p=2, q=0)   logL =    -304.6772195273
                                 sum  =    -901.0562829721
                                 joint=    -901.0562829728
  (both sides untruncated; the fit's own logL, xi truncated at 1e-03, is -901.0562829728)

  crossing identity (joint - sum) = -6.987e-10   (tolerance 1.0e-06)   VERIFIED
  rung 1  (F diag, Theta diag, Sigma free)   logL = -684.9987531938
  rung 2  (F free, Theta free, Sigma free)   logL = -667.6772449102

